  ('mth-121-calculus', 'MTH 121: Functions, Limits, Differentiation & Integration', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences', 'Mathematics', '100 Level', 'Find ∫ 4x^3 - 2x dx.', '["2x^4 - 2x^2 + C", "4x^3 - 2x + C", "12x^2 - 2 + C", "x^4 - x^2 + C"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Using the power rule for antiderivatives term by term: ∫4x^3 - 2x dx = x^4 - x^2 + C.', 'Antiderivatives of Some Elementary Functions', true),
